+// The slim profile on Windows has no Dawn (use_dawn and skia_use_dawn false).
+// D3DImageBacking keeps its Dawn paths compiled; nothing reaches them without
+// a Dawn device, so what they would call is not linked. The cache is made with
+// every backing and stays empty.
+
